cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or benchmark, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Lost in Localization: Benchmarking Intralingual Cultural Adaptation in Large Language Models"
abstract: >
  CulturalAdapt-6K is a 6,000-item benchmark for evaluating function-preserving
  intralingual cultural adaptation (American→Indian). This repository contains
  the dataset construction pipeline, adaptation generation code for eight
  instruction-tuned LLMs, and a seven-phase CSI-level evaluation framework
  grounded in the Intercultural Adaptation Error Taxonomy (IAET).
authors:
